# Differences meant between this text's PDF (as pdftotext reads it) and its web page, for tools/check_text.py.
# OLD=NEW: the PDF text says OLD, the page says NEW. "order: <start of a paragraph>": pdftotext reads it out of order.
# A real hyphen in the Bainbridge DOI that falls at the end of a line in the PDF, which pdftotext joins up:
10.1016/00051098=10.1016/0005-1098
